    "methods_description": "Intracranial EEG recordings were acquired during epilepsy surgery procedures and long-term monitoring periods. Intraoperative recordings were organized into pre-resection, intermediate, and post-resection sessions relative to surgical resection timing. Long-term recordings were grouped by monitoring period with runs indicating day and time point of acquisition. Different electrode configurations (grids, strips, depth electrodes) and recording modalities (ECoG and stereo-encephalography) were employed depending on clinical requirements.",
